#
# motion-logger stands in for the motion module, as in LinuxCNC's own
# tests/motion-logger: it writes every command task sends to motion,
# with its end point in machine coordinates and its source line, to
# out.motion-logger. It moves nothing and checks no limits.

loadusr -W motion-logger out.motion-logger
setp iocontrol.0.emc-enable-in 1
